            "type": "text",
            "value": "INLETS\n\n• Input\nThe texture you want to crop.\n\n• Invert (hidden by default)\nSend a boolean to invert the cropping\n\n• Left / Right / Top / Bottom\nSend in a float to change the amount of crop from these four direction.s"
